"settings.providers.hint.ollama" = "Install Ollama from ollama.com. Pull a model first: `ollama pull llama3.3`. Runs locally, no key, no cloud.";
"settings.providers.hint.mlx" = "Tippi starts mlx_lm.server automatically. The default is Gemma 4 E2B — in testing it was both the most accurate and the fastest. Qwen 3.5 2B downloads the least but makes more mistakes. What exactly was measured is in Help under \"Which local model for dictation?\". No cloud, no key.";
